- 4 new hats (Steam items);
- More options for hero upgrades;
- Upgrade now occurs every 4 levels instead of every 8 levels;
- Added Ukrainian language;
- Bug fixes.

Hey! I received feedback from you and am responding quickly.

- Now increasing the level hero enhances the hero's perk (it affects each one differently);
- Perk "Vampirism" has been increased and at the first level now restores 4 HP instead of 1 HP;
- The "Dungeon" has been got easier, the birds are now slower.

- The screen in the hero selection menu is now darkened to make it easier to read the abilities;
- Clicking on an inaccessible item is now transferred to the Steam Marketplace;
- Birds in the Dungeon now fly from both sides, but more slowly;
- Increased the reward for the first boss victory and the average drop of stars.

Bug fixes: 
- the choice of hat is now remembered and not reset;
- descriptions of headers no longer overlap each other;
- the incorrect description of the "Backup shot" has been fixed;
- fixed stand animation of the robot;
- incorrect description of the witch's hat has been fixed;
- the old version of the game is available again.

